{0 ocgdk}

The {b ocgdk} package provides OCaml bindings for GDK 4: the low-level
windowing, displays, input and events that GTK is built on. They are
generated from GDK's GObject introspection data.

{1 Modules}

The library is reached as {!Ocgdk}, with one module per class, interface or
record, such as {!Ocgdk.Display} and {!Ocgdk.Texture}.

{b {{!page-modules}All classes, interfaces and records}}

{ul
{- {!Ocgdk.Enums} — enumerations and bitfields. }
{- {!Ocgdk.Constants} — constants. }
{- {!Ocgdk.Raw} — the C externals and abstract types the modules above are
   built on. }
}

{1 Dependencies}

It builds on {!Ocglib} (GLib and GObject), {!Occairo}, {!Ocgdkpixbuf},
{!Ocgio}, {!Ocpango} and {!Ocpangocairo}.
